    <chapter title="Test Scenarios">
        <procedure title="Adds A Client Status" id="test-1">
            <p><b>Scenario:</b> Add Client Status</p>
            <p>Creates a new client status with a faker-generated mapping reference</p>
            <p><b>Priority:</b> Medium</p>
            <p><b>Test Data:</b> Name: "Status Test"; Mapping Reference: faker string(11)</p>
            <step>Navigate to Settings → Client Statuses</step>
            <step>Click Add; fill Name & Mapping Reference</step>
            <step>Choose values for Color and Status dropdowns</step>
            <step>Click Save</step>
            <chapter title="Expected Results">
                <p>• Toast appears: "The client status has been added."</p>
            </chapter>
        </procedure>
